Package: nexa-assistant
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Nexa Maintainers <tauseeqtufail649@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libgl1, libegl1, dbus, polkitd | policykit-1, systemd
Recommends: adb, wireplumber, libreoffice-writer, poppler-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://assistant.nexadownloadmanager.com
Description: Nexa Assistant - a Linux AI assistant for the desktop and the phone
 Ask it to run commands, open apps, work in the browser, read the screen as
 text, drive an Android phone, and talk to it by voice. It works with your own
 AI providers and programs; Qt, whisper.cpp, sherpa-onnx and Piper are bundled,
 and the speech models download from inside Settings.
